# API Rules (apps/api)

## Tech Stack
- Hono framework
- TypeScript strict mode
- Zod for request validation

## Conventions
- Routes in `src/routes/` — one file per resource
- Validate all input with Zod schemas
- Return consistent JSON: `{ data }` on success, `{ error, details? }` on failure
- Log with structured metadata: `{ method, path, status, duration }`

## Security
- CORS restricted to known origins
- Rate limit sensitive endpoints (faucet, webhooks)
- Validate webhook signatures
- Never expose internal errors to clients

## Error Handling
- Use Hono's `HTTPException` for expected errors
- Catch unexpected errors at the middleware level
- Always return a JSON response, never HTML error pages
